 These auxiliary profiles are not asserted to converge for general gamma.","citation_ids":["support_flux_source","support_backward_source","support_forward_source","support_tails_source"],"evidence_ids":["support_source_bindings_20261024","support_graph_semantic_review_pending"],"id":"support.flux_identity","kind":"claim","label":"Nonnegative certificate variables and zero expected divergence","locator":"signs.tex:396–472; shape:ibp","source_id":"support_tex_signs","statement":"At a fixed positive time in a positive step with the preceding smooth profiles, define R=r^2, K=rs, b=-w/r, B=b-2v=-2H, j=s_x-(s/r)v, L=-r*s_xx, S=z+bv-2Rb=2rH_x. These extend evenly and smoothly, and R,K,v,B,j,L,S>=0. For D=r*partial_x and W(F)=D F+(v+R-K)F, the derivative rules in signs.tex give f W(F)=partial_x(r f F). For every polynomial F in R,K,v,b,j the terms are integrable, r f F vanishes at both infinities, and E_f W(F)=0.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.flux_identity","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.flux_identity","id":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/edges/%5B%22support.flux_identity%22%2C%22support.backward_shapes%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/edges/%5B%22support.flux_identity%22%2C%22support.backward_shapes%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.backward_shapes"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.flux_identity","id":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/edges/%5B%22support.flux_identity%22%2C%22suppo